INFO  2026-10-01 00:06:49,879 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.disk_reservation_percent:25	- The percentage of total disk capacity that Redpanda will avoid using. This applies both when cloud cache and log data share a disk, as well as when cloud cache uses a dedicated disk. It is recommended to not run disks near capacity to avoid blocking I/O due to low disk space, as well as avoiding performance issues associated with SSD garbage collection.
