INFO  2026-10-01 00:06:49,879 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.iceberg_backlog_controller_p_coeff:1e-05	- Proportional coefficient for the Iceberg backlog controller. Number of shares assigned to the datalake scheduling group will be proportional to the backlog size error.
